  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution to Start Network for two funds: the Start Fund and the Start Ready. The Start Fund supports early action to reduce humanitarian need in sudden onset crises and spikes in existing crises. Start Fund focus on 1) Reducing Hunger 2) Reducing Poverty 3) Gender Equality. Start Ready supports Anticipatory Action for reoccurring predictable climate event and focuses on 4) Climate Action 5) Disaster Risk Reduction</narrative>
